{
  "id": "575",
  "title": "Lili is Stood Up",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-10-24",
  "synopsis": "Lili feels a bit down after being stood up by Little He.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/870/6cb33fe3501c9d4fdf57bfd6e85b0115cdf4cf71.mp3?1589791889",
  "series": {
    "title": "Ben’s life in China 4: Trouble in Paradise",
    "chapter": 27,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "放鸽子\n\n本：丽丽，你看起来不太高兴，怎么了？\n丽丽：小何他放我鸽子！\n本：放鸽子？\n丽丽：对呀！\n本：鸽子？你什么时候养鸽子了？\n丽丽：哈哈！不是我养鸽子了。“放鸽子”还有“爽约”的意思。\n本：嗯……我还是不懂。\n丽丽：我和小何约好了一起去吃饭，但他没有来。那就是“我被放鸽子了”。\n本：啊，我懂了。谢谢你，丽丽！\n丽丽：应该我谢谢你。你这么一闹，我心情好多了。",
    "traditional": "放鴿子\n\n本：麗麗，你看起來不太高興，怎麼了？\n麗麗：小何他放我鴿子！\n本：放鴿子？\n麗麗：對呀！\n本：鴿子？你什麼時候養鴿子了？\n麗麗：哈哈！不是我養鴿子了。“放鴿子”還有“爽約”的意思。\n本：嗯……我還是不懂。\n麗麗：我和小何約好了一起去吃飯，但他沒有來。那就是“我被放鴿子了”。\n本：啊，我懂了。謝謝你，麗麗！\n麗麗：應該我謝謝你。你這麼一鬧，我心情好多了。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Being Stood Up"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：丽丽，你看起来不太高兴，怎么了？",
      "traditional": "本：麗麗，你看起來不太高興，怎麼了？",
      "pinyin": "běn lì lì nǐ kàn qǐ lái bú tài gāo xìng zěn me le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Lili, you look a bit down. What happened?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：小何他放我鸽子！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：小何他放我鴿子！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì xiǎo hé tā fàng wǒ gē zi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Little He stood me up!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：放鸽子？",
      "traditional": "本：放鴿子？",
      "pinyin": "běn fàng gē zi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: He released your pigeon?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：对呀！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：對呀！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì duì ya",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Yes!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "本：鸽子？你什么时候养鸽子了？",
      "traditional": "本：鴿子？你什麼時候養鴿子了？",
      "pinyin": "běn gē zi nǐ shén me shí hou yǎng gē zi le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Pigeon? When did you start raising pigeons?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "丽丽：哈哈！不是我养鸽子了。“放鸽子”还有“爽约”的意思。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：哈哈！不是我養鴿子了。“放鴿子”還有“爽約”的意思。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì hā hā bú shì wǒ yǎng gē zi le fàng gē zi hái yǒu shuǎng yuē de yì si",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Haha! I’m not raising pigeons. “Release pigeon” also means to “stand someone up”."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "本：嗯……我还是不懂。",
      "traditional": "本：嗯……我還是不懂。",
      "pinyin": "běn èn wǒ hái shì bù dǒng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Hmm… I still don’t get it."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我和小何约好了一起去吃饭，但他没有来。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我和小何約好了一起去吃飯，但他沒有來。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ hé xiǎo hé yuē hǎo le yì qǐ qù chī fàn dàn tā méi yǒu lái",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "那就是“我被放鸽子了”。",
      "traditional": "那就是“我被放鴿子了”。",
      "pinyin": "nà jiù shì wǒ bèi fàng gē zi le",
      "english": "Lili: Little He and I had promised to go eat together, but he didn’t show up."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "That is called “I was released a pigeon”."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "本：啊，我懂了。谢谢你，丽丽！",
      "traditional": "本：啊，我懂了。謝謝你，麗麗！",
      "pinyin": "běn a wǒ dǒng le xiè xie nǐ lì lì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Ah, I get it. Thank you, Lili!"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "丽丽：应该我谢谢你。你这么一闹，我心情好多了。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：應該我謝謝你。你這麼一鬧，我心情好多了。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì yīng gāi wǒ xiè xie nǐ nǐ zhè me yí nào wǒ xīn qíng hǎo duō le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I should be thanking you. Thanks to your little joke, I feel much better."
    }
  ],
